---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultationCTA from '../components/ConsultationCTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your First Visit | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Know what to expect at your complimentary orthodontic consultation in East Memphis, including patient forms, your exam, insurance, and payment options.">
  <main id="main" class="interior-page">
    <section class="patient-intro" aria-labelledby="patient-title"><div class="container"><div class="page-title-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">New Patients</p><h1 id="patient-title">A Comfortable<br>Place to <em>Begin.</em></h1></div><div class="page-intro-copy"><p>Your first visit is about getting to know each other, understanding your smile, and making a plan together.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#form">Plan Your First Visit</a><span class="visit-note">Your consultation is complimentary.</span></div></div><div class="patient-photo"><img src="/assets/first-visit.webp" alt="A child with braces and a parent discussing orthodontic care" width="1000" height="667" fetchpriority="high"></div></div></section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="expect-title"><div class="container editorial-grid"><div><h2 id="expect-title">Here’s What<br>to Expect.</h2><p class="supporting-copy">Bring your questions. We’ll walk through the details with you.</p></div><ol class="appointment-steps"><li><span class="step-index">01</span><div><h3>Get Ready for Your Visit</h3><p>Once your consultation is scheduled, our team will provide your patient forms in advance and make sure you have what you need for your appointment.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-index">02</span><div><h3>Get a Complete Picture</h3><p>We’ll take photographs of your face and teeth, X-rays, and, in some cases, digital 3D scans. After that, Dr. Rachel will perform a comprehensive orthodontic exam.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-index">03</span><div><h3>Talk through Your Options</h3><p>Dr. Rachel will formulate and discuss a treatment plan customized to meet your individual needs or those of your child. You’ll have time to ask questions and understand the next steps, including payment and insurance details.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
    <section class="section ice-section" id="patient-forms" aria-labelledby="forms-title"><div class="container practical-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Before Your Appointment</p><h2 id="forms-title">We’ll Send<br>the Paperwork.</h2><p>All new patient forms are provided by our office ahead of your visit. If you’ve scheduled an appointment and need help finding or completing them, give us a call.</p><a class="text-link" href="tel:+19016250202">Call 901.625.0202</a></div><div class="payment-copy" id="payment-options"><h2>Let’s Make Sense<br>of the Numbers.</h2><p>We offer flexible payment plans and accept most insurance providers. Our team will help you understand your estimated benefits and work with you on a plan that fits your budget.</p><p>You’ll have a chance to discuss these details at your complimentary consultation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/cost-and-financing/">Explore Cost &amp; Financing</a></div></div></section>
    <ConsultationCTA title="We’re Ready When You Are." description="Contact our team to arrange your complimentary consultation with Dr. Rachel." />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
